   - A description.
   - Data privacy settings indicating that the bot is not child-directed.
   - An idle session TTL of 300 seconds.
   - The ARN of the IAM role created earlier.
   - The type of the bot set to `Bot`.

This configuration ensures that the Lex V2 bot is properly set up with the necessary IAM permissions.

