2. **S3 Bucket Creation**: An S3 bucket named `my_bucket` is created with private access.
3. **S3 Bucket Policy**: A bucket policy is attached to the S3 bucket. The policy denies all S3 actions (`s3:*`) for any principal (`*`) accessing the bucket from the specified IP address (`192.168.1.1/32`). The policy includes a version number (`2012-10-17`) and an identifier (`DenyAccessFromSpecificIP`).

