This Terraform configuration creates a VPC with a CIDR block of `10.0.0.0/16`, two public subnets in different availability zones (`us-west-2a` and `us-west-2b`), and an internet gateway attached to the VPC. The public route table is configured to route all traffic (`0.0.0.0/0`) to the internet gateway, and both public subnets are associated with this route table.

